\id MAT Matthew
\h Matthew
\mt1 The Gospel According to Saint Matthew
\c 4
\p
\v 3 And when the tempter came to him, he said, If thou be the Son of God, command that these stones be made bread.
\p
\v 4 But he answered and said, \wj It is written, Man shall not live by bread alone, but by every word that proceedeth out of the mouth of God.\wj*
\p
\v 10 Then saith Jesus unto him, \wj Get thee hence, Satan: for it is written, Thou shalt worship the \nd Lord\nd* thy God, and him only shalt thou serve.\wj*
